                "text": "We sent a letter to Arizona\u2019s House Republicans responding to their call to end the shutdown. We agree. It\u2019s time to get this done and the path is clear: come back to Washington and help us keep health care premiums from spiking and reopen the government. https://t.co/D9igRAmcJq",
