                "text": "This administration fired a bunch of scientists and experts at the CDC, the people who keep us safe from infectious diseases. Treating federal workers like political pawns doesn\u2019t do anything to solve this shutdown or to prevent health care premiums from spiking for Americans. https://t.co/kUReAFCz7k",
