                "retweet_count": 151,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Health care premiums are set to double for millions of Americans next year \u2014 the biggest increase since the ACA marketplaces launched. It doesn\u2019t have to be this way. We can extend the ACA tax credits and keep health care affordable. https://t.co/KlLVRwCbeQ",
