                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I keep hearing from Arizonans who are worried about what happens if ACA tax credits expire and their premiums skyrocket. For many, it\u2019s the difference between keeping their health care or keeping their business or home. \ud83e\uddf5",
