                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Dennis is 66 and just went on Medicare, but his wife still relies on ACA coverage. Without the tax credits, her premium would soar to $1,100 a month. With costs like that, they won\u2019t be able to live the retirement they worked decades for.",
