                "text": "This shutdown isn\u2019t about Republicans vs. Democrats. This is about whether millions of Americans, like Leslie from Buckeye, can afford basic health insurance. I\u2019ve been talking to a lot of people across Arizona whose premiums are going to become unaffordable. https://t.co/i9jCxa3iAI",
