                "text": "Millions of Americans could find themselves in a situation where they have to choose between having health insurance or paying rent.   \n\nThat's on this president.   \n\nHe's kicked people off Medicaid and jacked up health care premiums to pay for tax cuts for rich people. https://t.co/1XdABTeGY3",
