                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every day, I get stories from folks worried about how they\u2019ll afford health care when their premiums skyrocket in January. This week, I will be voting to extend these tax credits and stop that from happening. We\u2019ll see where Republicans stand. https://t.co/MqYybOvVP3",
