                "reply_count": 643,
                "retweet_count": 229,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today\u2019s vote came down to a simple choice: protect working families from skyrocketing health care costs or let premiums double or even triple. Unfortunately, just as they have done for months, Republicans chose higher prices for Americans. \n  \nArizona families are already stretched thin, trying to afford groceries, gas, rent, and basic necessities in the face of Trump\u2019s tariffs and rising costs. And now more than 300,000 Arizonans will face crushing premium increases in a matter of weeks - with some unable to afford coverage at all.  \n  \nThe only way to fix this is by working together, and I\u2019m ready to sit down with anyone to find solutions so that Arizonans can afford the health care they need.",
